      "signpost": "one or the other",
      "definition": "one or the other of two people or things, when it does not matter which",
      "explanation": "**Either** stands alone, without a following noun, often before **of**: *either of us*, *I don't mind either*. Directly before a noun, **either** is a determiner, a separate entry.",
